      "topics": ["green-shipping-corridors", "inland-shipping"],
      "regions": ["Global", "China", "Europe", "North America"],
      "tags": ["AIS", "emissions", "rivers", "inland-shipping", "climate"],
      "takeaways": ["2022 年内河船舶排放估计为 164.0 ± 1.58 TgCO₂，约占全球水运船舶排放的 24.7%。", "排放最高的 20 条河流贡献了总量的 68.72%。"],
